Landing page clip
  src/components/landing/clip/robocup2026-final.rcg.gz

  Cycles 2490 to 2725 of the RoboCup 2026 Soccer Simulation 2D final, HELIOS2026 0 x 1
  YuShan2026, cut with `just clip-rcg`. The full log is
  logs/U/GdwD62P/GdwD62P_server1_HELIOS2026_0-vs-YuShan2026_1.rcg (sha256
  8783fe04bf9bbbf873e5cf1825280d1313338d8dac29917f79651ff7e89eba29) inside
  rc26_day4_finals_logs.tar.gz, published by the league's organizing committee on the RoboCup 2026
  "Logs & Bins" page at https://www.rcss.dev/rc26/rc26-logsbins. The page states no license.
  The log is what rcssserver wrote during the match. It also carries the two teams' logos
  (team_graphic messages), which belong to HELIOS and YuShan.

  The clip is not covered by the GPL. It is here so the landing page shows a real match. If you
  hold rights to it and want it removed, open an issue.

Test fixtures
  src/rcg/fixtures/rcss2d-mirror-300.rcg.gz
  src/rcg/fixtures/rcss2d-mirror-live-215.txt.gz

  Recorded by the author on a local rcssserver 19.0.0: a .rcg and a monitor stream of matches
  played by the author's own team. No third-party log. Same license as the rest of the
  repository.

